  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently the world is stateless. Cookies is a proven feature for browsers, and it's the same with VRChat based on numerous unity \"websites\". It's important for worlds to keep state locally across instances, so that VRChat could actually be able to support large unity games, so that you don't restart the game every time.",
